    {
      "id": "claim_7171f4738f3b49b5a5b7a8d453c3b201",
      "statement": "The profile model is cumulative: runtimeProfileEnablesOperator() is true for both 'operator' and 'autonomous', while runtimeProfileEnablesAutonomy() is true only for 'autonomous', so the autonomous profile is a superset of the operator stack and there is no way to enable autonomy without the operator stack.",
