      "id": "claim_698c4cd59d3648dcaa3335116d070b5f",
      "statement": "main() resolves the profile before any subsystem init, then runs database init plus LoopService.recoverInterruptedRuns() in every profile; initExternalEventIngest(db) is called unconditionally in every profile even though it lives in bootstrap/operator-services.ts, while initOperatorServices(db) is gated on operatorRuntime and initAutonomousServices(db, recoverySvc) plus the LoopDaemon are gated on autonomousRuntime.",
