      "statement": "The LoopDaemon runs only under the autonomous profile and is constructed with the same shared LoopService instance used for boot recovery, so the daemon and the API share runtime leases; it polls the continuous goal queue at GOAL_QUEUE_POLL_MS (default 5000 ms), starting goals concurrently within the AIMD controller's global concurrency bound.",
