      "id": "claim_6daf349396b7485a9bb001612fdaf767",
      "statement": "initAutonomousServices constructs the autonomy core by default (BoardHandoffService with its own DJIMITFLO_BOARD_HANDOFF_AUTONOMY=false opt-out, ContinuousLearningLoop with TrajectoryStore, SwarmIntelligenceService, NestedSpawnService, NegotiationCoordinator, CapabilityAcquisitionService, MetaEvolutionService, CuriosityService + AutonomousGoalGenerator, the RSI trio RsiSafetyGuard/ServiceRefactoringAnalyzer/EmergentSpecializationService, and ExpertSwarmOrchestrator + WorkerPool + OkfKnowledgeUpdater), while peripheral services (CommonsProposalReview, AgentRegistrySync, EventOutbox, TestGapSource, DreamState, NeedsGroundingTriage, DiskGuard, QueueHygiene, KnowledgeMaintenance) are each default-off behind their own env-gated helper functions.",
