      "statement": "Autonomous-profile bootstrap is failure-tolerant: nearly every subsystem block in initAutonomousServices and the autonomous blocks of index.ts wrap construction and start in try/catch and log a non-fatal warning, and interval-based services are registered with the lifecycleManager under a serviceName for centralized shutdown; the autonomy core (ContinuousLearningLoop, SwarmIntelligenceService, NestedSpawnService) is the unguarded exception.",
